{"text": "detergent", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From French <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fr\">d\u00e9tergent</i>, from Latin <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">d\u0113terg\u0113ns</i>, the present participle of <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">d\u0113terge\u014d</i>, from <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">d\u0113</i> (\u201coff\u201d) + <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">terge\u014d</i> (\u201cwipe, polish\u201d).\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "Any non-soap cleaning agent, especially a synthetic surfactant.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {"Coordinate term": ["soap (sometimes loosely synonymous)"], "Near-synonym": ["cleaner (sometimes coordinate)"]}}]}, {"pos": "Adjective", "definitions": [{"definition": "Synonym of cleansing.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["UK", "/d\u026a\u02c8t\u025c\u02d0d\u0292\u0259nt/"]]}